note Layout view over a buffer shorter than the layout: omc refuses at compile time (error 7). The buffer's
note length is known, so the call is rejected before any field is read.
om2
layout lo 8
field a uint at 0 little
field b uint at 4 little
end
fn rd c view lo to uint
ret get c b
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 6 1
r = rd c
ret int ulong r
end
